<div class="page-head"><div class="titles"><h1>Daily digest</h1><p class="page-sub">Verified work for the selected UTC calendar day. Pending decisions show their current state, not a historical snapshot.</p></div></div>
<form method="get" action="/autopilot/daily" class="rm-inline-name"><label for="digest-date">Report date</label><input class="input" type="date" id="digest-date" name="date" value="<%= digest.date %>"><button class="btn" type="submit">Show day</button></form>
<section class="card section" aria-label="Automatic digest snapshots"><div class="card-head"><h2>Automatic digest snapshots</h2></div><div class="card-body"><p>The scheduled worker records the previous UTC day once per inventory. Pending counts are as of generation time. Provider and inventory records are separate; do not add them together. This is an in-app digest, not an email delivery promise.</p><% if (!digestHistory.length) { %><p>No automatic snapshot has been recorded yet. Check that the scheduled worker is running.</p><% } %><ul><% digestHistory.forEach(function (entry) { %><li><%= entry.report_date %> · generated <%= entry.generated_at %> · <%= entry.summary.verifiedWork %> verified inventory-work completions · <%= entry.summary.unverifiedWork %> unverified completions · <%= entry.summary.waiting %> waiting decisions · <%= entry.summary.unfinished %> unfinished · <%= entry.summary.verifiedProviderOperations %> verified provider operations · <%= entry.summary.unverifiedProviderOperations %> unverified provider operations</li><% }) %></ul></div></section>
<% if (batchResults.length) { %>
<section class="card section" aria-label="Batch results"><div class="card-head"><h2>Batch results</h2></div><div class="card-body"><ul><% batchResults.forEach(function (result) { %><li><a href="/autopilot/work/<%= result.id %>"><%= result.done ? 'Completed and verified' : result.status %></a><%= result.reason ? ': ' + result.reason : '' %></li><% }) %></ul></div></section>
<% } %>
<section class="card section" aria-label="Completed and verified"><div class="card-head"><h2>Completed and verified · <%= digest.completed.length %></h2></div><div class="card-body">
<% if (!digest.completed.length) { %><p>No verified completions were recorded on this day.</p><% } %>
<ul><% digest.completed.forEach(function (item) { %><li><a href="/autopilot/work/<%= item.id %>"><%= item.categoryLabel %> · <%= item.recommendedAction.displayName || item.recommendedAction.poNumber || item.id %></a><%= item.outcome.autoApproved === false ? ' — draft prepared only; nothing sent' : '' %></li><% }) %></ul></div></section>
<section class="card section" aria-label="Decisions waiting for you"><div class="card-head"><h2>Decisions waiting for you · <%= digest.waiting.length %></h2></div><div class="card-body">
<p>Open each decision to inspect its evidence and requirements. Select only the decisions you approve; execution rechecks the business state. A changed selection rejects the entire approval batch. At most 25 decisions per batch.</p>
<form method="post" action="/autopilot/daily/approve"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
<ul><% digest.waiting.forEach(function (item) { %><li><label><input type="checkbox" name="selected" value="<%= item.id %>:<%= item.approvalHash || '' %>" <%= item.approvalBlockedReason ? 'disabled' : '' %>> <%= item.categoryLabel %> · <%= item.recommendedAction.displayName || item.recommendedAction.poNumber || item.id %></label> <a href="/autopilot/work/<%= item.id %>">Review decision</a><% if (item.approvalBlockedReason) { %><p role="alert"><%= item.approvalBlockedReason %></p><% } else if (item.order) { %><p><%= item.order.supplierName %> · <%= item.order.currency %> <%= item.order.subtotal.toFixed(2) %> product subtotal · <%= item.order.orderedUnits %> inventory units. Approval records the order internally; it does not prove supplier delivery. Review the decision for charges and other requirements.</p><% } else { %><p><%= item.recommendedAction.quantity || '' %> <%= item.recommendedAction.displayName || '' %> · <%= item.policyEvaluation.reason || 'Review the complete evidence before approving.' %></p><% } %></li><% }) %></ul>
<button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit" <%= digest.waiting.length ? '' : 'disabled' %>>Approve selected decisions</button></form></div></section>
<section class="card section" aria-label="Unfinished or failed"><div class="card-head"><h2>Unfinished or failed · <%= digest.unfinished.length %></h2></div><div class="card-body"><ul><% digest.unfinished.forEach(function (item) { %><li><a href="/autopilot/work/<%= item.id %>"><%= item.categoryLabel %> · <%= item.executionStatus %></a><%= item.errorMessage ? ': ' + item.errorMessage : '' %></li><% }) %></ul></div></section>
<section class="card section" aria-label="Provider operations"><div class="card-head"><h2>Provider operations</h2></div><div class="card-body"><p>Provider records are separate from inventory work and must not be double-counted. Queued, running or unverified work is not proof of delivery, payment or a purchased label.</p><ul><% digest.providerOperations.forEach(function (operation) { var verification = JSON.parse(operation.verification || '{}'); %><li><%= operation.title %> · <%= operation.status === 'COMPLETED' ? (verification.passed === true ? 'COMPLETED AND VERIFIED' : 'COMPLETED — UNVERIFIED') : operation.status %> · <%= operation.phase %></li><% }) %></ul></div></section>
<section class="card section" aria-label="Supplier email status"><div class="card-head"><h2>Supplier email status</h2></div><div class="card-body"><p>Prepared or queued is not sent. Sent means the mailbox accepted it, not that the supplier read or received it.</p><ul><% digest.communications.forEach(function (message) { %><li><%= message.subject %> · <%= message.recipient || 'No recipient set' %> · <%= message.status %><%= message.status === 'SENT' && !message.external_message_id ? ' — missing provider confirmation' : '' %></li><% }) %></ul></div></section>
<% if (digest.suggestions.length) { %><section class="card section" aria-label="Approvals that can become policy"><div class="card-head"><h2>Make repeated work automatic?</h2></div><div class="card-body"><p>Five similar approvals earned these suggestions. Nothing changes until you review and confirm the exact limits.</p><ul><% digest.suggestions.forEach(function (suggestion) { %><li><a href="/operating-instructions/<%= suggestion.id %>"><%= suggestion.summary %></a></li><% }) %></ul></div></section><% } %>
